title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/metarecord-list:open
catalog: GUI command
target: metarecord-list:open
summary: Metarecord list: open the selection (here / other / new)

!! Reference

* Defined by the ``metarecord-list`` panel

!! Default keys

* ``b enter`` → ``metarecord-list:open new`` (in the ``metarecord-list`` panel)
* ``enter`` → ``metarecord-list:open other`` (in the ``metarecord-list`` panel)
* ``i enter`` → ``metarecord-list:open here`` (in the ``metarecord-list`` panel)
* ``right`` → ``metarecord-list:open other`` (in the ``metarecord-list`` panel)
